<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Happy BirthDay</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="page_1">
<div id="fading-screen"></div>
<section id="section1">
    <h1>Some days deserve</h1>
    <h1>a little more than</h1>
    <h1>an ordinary wish…</h1>
</section>

<section id="section2">
<!--    <img src="/page_2-moon.png">-->
    <h2>A surprise is waiting for you.</h2>
    <h2>Tap on the moon</h2>
    <div id="moon"></div>
    <h1 id="bday_wish">SOUMYA <p>💗</p></h1>
</section>

<section id="section3">
        <div id="bday_wish_msg">
            <h3 id="hbd">
                HAPPY BIRTHDAY SOUMYA
            </h3>
            <p>
                I genuinely don't know ki mai ye letter kaise start karu. Kehne ko to mere paas bahut tha, but ab jab likhne
                ka time aaya, pura mind blank hogya.
                But the one thing i want to say is "Happy Birthday, <strong> SOUMYA</strong>". This is a very special day
                for you and I wanted to wish you in person in a very special way, but unfortunately that's not possible.
            </p>
            <p>
                But, I'm writing this letter bcz I want you to remember that you're very special, mai aur Bahut se log sirf
                teri presence ke karan khush hai. I wish that your day goes with happiness and love. I wish ki sab teri bhi
                waise hi care kare jaise tu sabki karti hai. And teri aisi kaafi choti choti achi chize hai jo sabko khush
                karti hai, maybe you don't realize that, but a lot ppl are really happy bcz of your presence. And in the
                end, i just wanna say is that be happy and always keep smiling, tere cute se face pr suit karta hai ye sab.
            </p>
            <p>
                And you don't need to reply to this. I just wanted to wish you with all my heart and wanted you to remember
                that you're very special. And once again,
            </p>
            <h3>HAPPY BIRTHDAY, SOUMYA</h3>
            <h3>"Stay Happy and Keep Smiling"</h3>

            <button id="continue">
                Continue
            </button>
        </div>

    <h3 style="text-shadow: 0 0 3px var(--night);" id="cotl">
        Click on the Letter
    </h3>

    <svg id="envelope" viewBox="0 0 320 260" width="320"
         xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Envelope back -->
        <rect x="20" y="100" width="280" height="140" rx="8"
              fill="#efddc4" stroke="#c6aa89"/>

        <!-- Opening flap -->
        <path class="flap" d="M20 100H300L160 190Z"
              fill="#fff4e3" stroke="#c6aa89"
              stroke-linejoin="round"/>

        <!-- Blank paper -->
        <rect class="paper"
              x="40" y="110" width="240" height="120" rx="3"
              fill="white" stroke="#e0d5c5"/>

        <!-- Front pocket -->
        <path d="M20 100L160 190L300 100V232Q300 240 292 240H28Q20 240 20 232Z"
              fill="#f8e8d1" stroke="#c6aa89"
              stroke-linejoin="round"/>

        <!-- Cake-shaped seal -->
        <g class="seal" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M134 173H186V206H134Z"
                  fill="#d98198" stroke="#b75c75" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M134 173H186V183Q180 193 174 183Q167 193 160 183Q153 193 147 183Q140 193 134 183Z"
                  fill="#ffe1dc"/>
            <path d="M131 208H189" stroke="#b75c75"
                  stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M160 171V159" stroke="#d98198" stroke-width="5"/>
            <path d="M160 145Q149 158 160 158Q171 158 160 145"
                  fill="#efb659"/>
        </g>
    </svg>

    <div id="paper-overlay"></div>

</section>
<div id="swipeSVG">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
         viewBox="0 0 24 48"
         width="24"
         height="36"
         fill="none"
         style="text-shadow: 0 0 3px var(--text)">
        <path d="M12 46 V3 M2 13 L12 3 L22 13"
              stroke="var(--violet)"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>

    <span style="color: var(--violet); text-shadow: 0 0 3px var(--text)">Swipe Up</span>
</div>

<script src="/index.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
